% Quasi-modal be and modal-flavoured infinitival relatives (the man to fix it)
% are modeled by the 'eventuality' relation scoping (qeq) over the infinitival
% clause.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_QuasiModalInfinitivals/):
%   eventuality[ARG1 h1]
%   h2:[ARG0 e]
%   { h1 =q h2 }

pattern { E [pred="eventuality"]; E -[1=ARG1, post=HEQ]-> V }
